OL,3,GNEWSAJohn Swinney 'did nothing' about
OL,4,ANHS Grampian concerns - party leaders
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe state of NHS Grampian was raised at
OL,7,FFMQs, prompting John Swinney to say
OL,8,Fthat fresh allegations are of the
OL,9,F"gravest concern"
OL,11,FThursday's Q&A came days after Health
OL,12,FSecretary Angela Constance made a
OL,13,Fstatement in the Scottish Parliament
OL,14,Fabout leadership failings at the health
OL,15,Fboard
OL,17,FHours before FMQs, a surgeon went
OL,18,Fpublic about the unnecessary deaths of
OL,19,Fpatients following surgeries at
OL,20,FAberdeen Royal Infirmary
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,423,420,260,160,0,100
