OL,3,GNEWSAJohn Swinney 'did nothing' about
OL,4,ANHS Grampian concerns - party leaders
OL,5,
OL,6,FScottish Labour leader Michael Marra
OL,7,Faccused the FM of knowing how bad the
OL,8,Fsituation was and did "nothing". He
OL,9,Fwent on to urge the Lord Advocate to
OL,10,Flaunch a criminal prosecution
OL,12,FScottish Conservative leader Russell
OL,13,FFindlay echoed those words, arguing
OL,14,Fthat Swinney was told three times about
OL,15,Fthe "industrial scale" problems and did
OL,16,F"nothing"
OL,18,FWhen Swinney was asked if he would have
OL,19,Fan operation at the Aberdeen Royal
OL,20,FInfirmary he said "yes", adding that
OL,21,Fpatients should be confident that their
OL,22,Fsafety was of paramount importance
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,423,420,260,160,0,100
