OL,3,GNEWSAJohn Swinney 'did nothing' about
OL,4,ANHS Grampian concerns - party leaders
OL,5,
OL,6,FScotland's UK Reform leader Malcolm
OL,7,FOfford asked the FM about the "crisis"
OL,8,Fof young people not in work; Scottish
OL,9,FGreen leader Gillian Mackay asked about
OL,10,FNHS Grampian and data centres and
OL,11,FScottish Lib Dem leader Alex
OL,12,FCole-Hamilton raised the problematic IT
OL,13,Fsystems used at GP surgeries and by
OL,14,Fother public bodies
